  "text": "{\"additions\": {\"A0\": {\"answer\": \"Centerville no longer exists as an independent municipality; it merged with Middleton in 1837 to form Cuba.\", \"support_1\": \"D1S3\", \"support_2\": \"D2S3\"}, \"A1\": {\"answer\": \"The population figures cited in the documents (1,294 in D1S2 and 5,000 in D2S2/D2S8) refer to Cuba, Illinois, not Centerville.\", \"support_1\": \"D1S2\", \"support_2\": \"D2S2\"}, \"A2\": {\"answer\": \"Centerville was one of two rival towns that merged to create Cuba, meaning it has no current separate population.\", \"support_1\": \"D1S3\", \"support_2\": \"D2S3\"}\n, \"A3\": {\"answer\": \"\", \"support_1\": \"\", \"support_2\": \"\"}, \"A4\": {\"answer\": \"\", \"support_1\": \"\", \"support_2\": \"\"}, \"A5\": {\"answer\": \"\", \"support_1\": \"\", \"support_2\": \"\"}, \"A6\": {\"answer\": \"\", \"support_1\": \"\", \"support_2\": \"\"}, \"A7\": {\"answer\": \"\", \"support_1\": \"\", \"support_2\": \"\"}, \"A8\": {\"answer\": \"\", \"support_1\": \"\", \"support_2\": \"\"}, \"A9\": {\"answer\": \"\", \"support_1\": \"\", \"support_2\": \"\"}, \"A10\": {\"answer\": \"\", \"support_1\": \"\", \"support_2\": \"\"}, \"A11\": {\"answer\": \"\", \"support_1\": \"\", \"support_2\": \"\"}}\n, \"explanation\": \"The provided documents discuss Cuba, Illinois, which was formed by the merger of Centerville and Middleton in 1837. Consequently, Centerville does not exist as a separate entity with a current population. The documents provide conflicting population figures for Cuba (1,294 vs 5,000), but neither applies to Centerville. The additions clarify that Centerville is a historical name within the merged entity of Cuba and explain why no current population exists for it.\"}",
